## README layout (when writing new or major rewrites)

Value prop → industry context → features → comparison table → ASCII architecture → ecosystem repos (dual audience) → licensing → phased roadmap.

## Security (copy in git)

No private strategy doc URLs, no `.env`, no `~/.cursor/mcp.json`, no absolute home paths for adapters.
